## 🏦 Phase 3: The Code Vending Machine (Phase 9.5)

I have established a direct link between revenue and labor by implementing an autonomous vending logic.

### 🤖 Logic Flow

- **Payment Gated Build**: The "Build" action is now locked until a successful Solana transaction is verified.
- **Autonomous Trigger**: Upon verification, the [CodeVendingMachine](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/CodeVendingMachine.tsx#6-105) automatically hits the Orchestrator API to start the build.
- **HUD Integration**: The Sovereign IDE HUD now features a unified "Economic Terminal" combining vault balance and POS terminal.

### Changes

- **[NEW] [CodeVendingMachine.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/CodeVendingMachine.tsx)**: The hub for pay-per-feature labor.
- **[MODIFY] [SolanaMerchant.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/SolanaMerchant.tsx)**: Added `onPaymentSuccess` callback for workflow automation.
- **[MODIFY] [SovereignIDE.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/SovereignIDE.jsx)**: Deployed the Vending Machine to the main dashboard.

